  ],
  "cues": [
    {
      "scene": 0,
      "start": 30,
      "duration": 39,
      "text": "Start with this map.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/intro-001.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 0,
      "start": 80,
      "duration": 85,
      "text": "At the center, Agent Loop forms a ring.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/intro-002.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 0,
      "start": 176,
      "duration": 129,
      "text": "It receives events, routes\ntasks by deterministic policy,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/intro-003.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 0,
      "start": 316,
      "duration": 75,
      "text": "and connects results to the next step.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/intro-004.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 0,
      "start": 402,
      "duration": 89,
      "text": "This routing core does\nnot call a language model.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/intro-005.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 0,
      "start": 502,
      "duration": 71,
      "text": "Inside are two shared services.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/intro-006.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 0,
      "start": 584,
      "duration": 136,
      "text": "Message Center gathers news,\nnotifications and work outputs",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/intro-007.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 0,
      "start": 731,
      "duration": 110,
      "text": "into readable information\nfor search and subscriptions.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/intro-008.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 0,
      "start": 852,
      "duration": 139,
      "text": "LoopLab runs tests and produces\nacceptance results with evidence.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/intro-009.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 0,
      "start": 1002,
      "duration": 63,
      "text": "Around the ring are personal Duets.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/intro-010.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 0,
      "start": 1076,
      "duration": 143,
      "text": "Each understands assignments,\nuses tools, completes work,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/intro-011.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 0,
      "start": 1230,
      "duration": 74,
      "text": "and follows up through memory and Tracking.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/intro-012.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 0,
      "start": 1315,
      "duration": 81,
      "text": "Each Duet connects outward to its own Owner:",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/intro-013.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 0,
      "start": 1407,
      "duration": 93,
      "text": "the employee who sets goals\nand makes judgments.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/intro-014.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 0,
      "start": 1511,
      "duration": 53,
      "text": "People address their own Duet.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/intro-015.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 0,
      "start": 1575,
      "duration": 119,
      "text": "Across roles, Duets\ncoordinate by leaving tasks,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/intro-016.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 0,
      "start": 1705,
      "duration": 82,
      "text": "materials and results in a shared topic.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/intro-017.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 0,
      "start": 1798,
      "duration": 47,
      "text": "Now follow one flow.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/intro-018.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 0,
      "start": 1856,
      "duration": 144,
      "text": "A Duet finds relevant information\nin Message Center and suggests an action.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/intro-019.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 0,
      "start": 2011,
      "duration": 123,
      "text": "The employee decides to proceed,\nand Duet starts work.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/intro-020.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 0,
      "start": 2145,
      "duration": 77,
      "text": "A task result returns to Agent Loop,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/intro-021.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 0,
      "start": 2233,
      "duration": 121,
      "text": "where policy passes it to the\nnext responsible person’s Duet.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/intro-022.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 0,
      "start": 2365,
      "duration": 114,
      "text": "When acceptance is needed,\nLoopLab runs the tests",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/intro-023.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 0,
      "start": 2490,
      "duration": 68,
      "text": "and sends the result back into the loop.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/intro-024.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 0,
      "start": 2569,
      "duration": 29,
      "text": "People judge.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/intro-025.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 0,
      "start": 2609,
      "duration": 45,
      "text": "Duets do the work.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/intro-026.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 0,
      "start": 2665,
      "duration": 74,
      "text": "Message Center supplies information,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/intro-027.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 0,
      "start": 2750,
      "duration": 156,
      "text": "LoopLab supplies acceptance evidence,\nand Agent Loop connects the steps.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/intro-028.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 0,
      "start": 2917,
      "duration": 170,
      "text": "Next, we will see how this map works,\nstarting with one person’s delegation.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/intro-029.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 1,
      "start": 3162,
      "duration": 125,
      "text": "A company runs through the connected\nresponsibilities of many people.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/001.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 1,
      "start": 3298,
      "duration": 111,
      "text": "Each person can begin by handing\npart of their work to an AI,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/002.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 1,
      "start": 3420,
      "duration": 72,
      "text": "whether that means collecting information,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/003.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 1,
      "start": 3503,
      "duration": 90,
      "text": "preparing a report\nor following an ongoing task.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/004.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 1,
      "start": 3604,
      "duration": 124,
      "text": "In this design, each employee’s\npersonal AI is called Duet.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/005.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 1,
      "start": 3739,
      "duration": 147,
      "text": "When one Duet’s output becomes something\nthe next person can use directly,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/006.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 1,
      "start": 3897,
      "duration": 89,
      "text": "those individual delegations\nstart to connect.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/007.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 1,
      "start": 3997,
      "duration": 133,
      "text": "With a clear starting point,\nhandoffs and acceptance conditions,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/008.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 1,
      "start": 4141,
      "duration": 119,
      "text": "a business process can keep moving\nthrough rules and human judgment.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/009.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 1,
      "start": 4271,
      "duration": 81,
      "text": "This is how we approach AI-native work.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/010.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 2,
      "start": 4427,
      "duration": 80,
      "text": "Bob messages me and asks for a report.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/011.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 2,
      "start": 4518,
      "duration": 100,
      "text": "I select his message,\nbring it to my own Duet,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/012.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 2,
      "start": 4629,
      "duration": 116,
      "text": "and say, prepare this report,\nthen send it to Bob.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/013.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 2,
      "start": 4756,
      "duration": 146,
      "text": "The quotation carries the original request\nand the conversation it came from.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/014.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 2,
      "start": 4913,
      "duration": 110,
      "text": "My Duet organizes the data,\ncompletes the report,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/015.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 2,
      "start": 5034,
      "duration": 146,
      "text": "and uses a sending tool to post the file\nas me in that original conversation.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/016.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 2,
      "start": 5191,
      "duration": 95,
      "text": "Sending is part of the task\nI have just assigned.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/017.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 2,
      "start": 5297,
      "duration": 96,
      "text": "Bob receives what he needs\nand continues his work.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/018.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 2,
      "start": 5404,
      "duration": 122,
      "text": "One small delegation has crossed\na handoff between two roles.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/019.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 3,
      "start": 5601,
      "duration": 88,
      "text": "Duet stays with the same employee over time.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/020.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 3,
      "start": 5700,
      "duration": 125,
      "text": "You can teach it your\nresponsibilities, preferred sources,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/021.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 3,
      "start": 5836,
      "duration": 86,
      "text": "working standards and communication style.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/022.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 3,
      "start": 5933,
      "duration": 128,
      "text": "During a day, you might assign\na report, discuss a customer,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/023.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 3,
      "start": 6072,
      "duration": 78,
      "text": "then ask about another piece of research.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/024.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 3,
      "start": 6161,
      "duration": 61,
      "text": "You keep addressing the same Duet.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/025.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 3,
      "start": 6233,
      "duration": 114,
      "text": "It works on the tasks separately\nand brings their results back.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/026.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 3,
      "start": 6358,
      "duration": 144,
      "text": "As the conversation grows, older\nmaterial is condensed into a summary",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/027.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 3,
      "start": 6513,
      "duration": 103,
      "text": "and the latest exchanges\nremain in their original form.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/028.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 3,
      "start": 6627,
      "duration": 133,
      "text": "You can continue the immediate discussion\nand return to ongoing work later.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/029.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 4,
      "start": 6835,
      "duration": 143,
      "text": "Imagine that, on Monday,\na crawler finds a regulatory update",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/030.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 4,
      "start": 6989,
      "duration": 120,
      "text": "concerning customers’ visibility\ninto application processing.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/031.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 4,
      "start": 7120,
      "duration": 108,
      "text": "Message Center keeps the source\nlink and publication date,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/032.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 4,
      "start": 7239,
      "duration": 104,
      "text": "adds a readable summary\nand classifies the information.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/033.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 4,
      "start": 7354,
      "duration": 102,
      "text": "Employees can browse, search and subscribe.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/034.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 4,
      "start": 7467,
      "duration": 90,
      "text": "Their Duets can look for information relevant",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/035.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 4,
      "start": 7568,
      "duration": 90,
      "text": "to their responsibilities\nor check on a schedule.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/036.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 4,
      "start": 7669,
      "duration": 140,
      "text": "This brings outside changes into\nthe company’s shared information space.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/037.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 4,
      "start": 7820,
      "duration": 96,
      "text": "An item can remain here\nuntil someone connects it",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/038.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 4,
      "start": 7927,
      "duration": 93,
      "text": "with work they are doing\nand decides how to respond.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/039.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 5,
      "start": 8095,
      "duration": 67,
      "text": "Nora handles market research.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/040.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 5,
      "start": 8173,
      "duration": 131,
      "text": "Her Duet knows she is following\nthe customer application experience,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/041.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 5,
      "start": 8315,
      "duration": 172,
      "text": "so it recommends this update and explains how\nit may affect the existing application page.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/042.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 5,
      "start": 8498,
      "duration": 118,
      "text": "Nora decides to investigate\nand asks Duet for research,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/043.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 5,
      "start": 8627,
      "duration": 70,
      "text": "a report and a requirements proposal.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/044.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 5,
      "start": 8708,
      "duration": 63,
      "text": "The outputs become specific.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/045.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 5,
      "start": 8782,
      "duration": 57,
      "text": "Which processes are affected?",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/046.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 5,
      "start": 8850,
      "duration": 47,
      "text": "What does the source say?",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/047.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 5,
      "start": 8908,
      "duration": 147,
      "text": "What should customers see, and what\nshould internal staff be able to export?",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/048.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 5,
      "start": 9066,
      "duration": 155,
      "text": "Maya receives these materials and can turn\nthe research into a product requirement.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/049.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 6,
      "start": 9296,
      "duration": 83,
      "text": "Nora can ask her Duet to bring the product,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/050.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 6,
      "start": 9390,
      "duration": 95,
      "text": "development and testing\ncolleagues into a human group.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/051.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 6,
      "start": 9496,
      "duration": 87,
      "text": "The people discuss scope\nand priorities there.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/052.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 6,
      "start": 9594,
      "duration": 123,
      "text": "Maya can take a message that needs\nwork and hand it to her own Duet.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/053.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 6,
      "start": 9728,
      "duration": 130,
      "text": "Meanwhile, Nora’s Duet creates\nand manages a linked topic,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/054.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 6,
      "start": 9869,
      "duration": 119,
      "text": "posts the research and invites\nthe relevant Duets to contribute.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/055.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 6,
      "start": 9999,
      "duration": 129,
      "text": "Each Duet brings its employee’s\nresponsibilities and uses that",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/056.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 6,
      "start": 10139,
      "duration": 119,
      "text": "employee’s group access to read\nthe shared history and files.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/057.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 6,
      "start": 10269,
      "duration": 53,
      "text": "People address their own Duet.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/058.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 6,
      "start": 10333,
      "duration": 72,
      "text": "The Duets coordinate through the topic,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/059.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 6,
      "start": 10416,
      "duration": 101,
      "text": "leaving work and replies for\none another asynchronously.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/060.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 7,
      "start": 10592,
      "duration": 150,
      "text": "On Thursday, Nora asks where the\napplication-status work has reached.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/061.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 7,
      "start": 10753,
      "duration": 113,
      "text": "Duet uses several forms\nof memory to recover the work.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/062.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 7,
      "start": 10877,
      "duration": 120,
      "text": "Recent context holds a summary\nand the latest exchanges.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/063.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 7,
      "start": 11008,
      "duration": 109,
      "text": "Every four hours, Dream\nincrementally reviews all",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/064.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 7,
      "start": 11128,
      "duration": 131,
      "text": "group conversations visible to the\nemployee and their conversations",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/065.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 7,
      "start": 11270,
      "duration": 112,
      "text": "with their own Duet,\nconsolidating lasting information.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/066.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 7,
      "start": 11393,
      "duration": 71,
      "text": "Git preserves versions and sources.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/067.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 7,
      "start": 11475,
      "duration": 86,
      "text": "If Monday’s plan conflicts with Thursday’s,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/068.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 7,
      "start": 11572,
      "duration": 137,
      "text": "Duet can trace the change and update\nmemory from the applicable decision.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/069.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 7,
      "start": 11720,
      "duration": 140,
      "text": "When Duet recognizes an ongoing\nmatter, it creates a Tracking item.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/070.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 7,
      "start": 11871,
      "duration": 88,
      "text": "Its first node describes\nthe item and its goal.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/071.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 7,
      "start": 11970,
      "duration": 124,
      "text": "That metadata stays in everyday\ncontext to help locate the work.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/072.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 7,
      "start": 12105,
      "duration": 79,
      "text": "Detailed progress is retrieved when needed,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/073.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 7,
      "start": 12195,
      "duration": 96,
      "text": "and new decisions\nand deliveries add further nodes.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/074.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 7,
      "start": 12302,
      "duration": 119,
      "text": "Work can continue across many\nintervening conversations.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/075.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 8,
      "start": 12496,
      "duration": 99,
      "text": "Maya writes the product\nrequirement as a user story.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/076.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 8,
      "start": 12606,
      "duration": 104,
      "text": "Alex’s Duet implements it\nand opens a pull request,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/077.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 8,
      "start": 12721,
      "duration": 102,
      "text": "or PR, proposing its code changes for review.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/078.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 8,
      "start": 12834,
      "duration": 105,
      "text": "GitHub emits an event\nidentifying the PR and commit.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/079.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 8,
      "start": 12950,
      "duration": 173,
      "text": "Agent Loop runs as a separate service and\nuses a policy file to send the review to Sam.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/080.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 8,
      "start": 13134,
      "duration": 120,
      "text": "The outer loop follows deterministic\nrules without calling a model.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/081.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 8,
      "start": 13265,
      "duration": 127,
      "text": "Sam’s Duet understands the code\nand checks it against the requirement.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/082.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 8,
      "start": 13403,
      "duration": 91,
      "text": "It finds that customers can see the status,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/083.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 8,
      "start": 13505,
      "duration": 85,
      "text": "while the internal report\nstill lacks the field.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/084.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 8,
      "start": 13601,
      "duration": 143,
      "text": "It returns specific feedback and a\nstructured changes-requested result.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/085.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 8,
      "start": 13755,
      "duration": 132,
      "text": "Agent Loop reads that outcome and routes\nthe next task back to the author.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/086.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 9,
      "start": 13962,
      "duration": 145,
      "text": "The rule writes the feedback to the PR\nand assigns the correction to Alex’s Duet.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/087.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 9,
      "start": 14118,
      "duration": 101,
      "text": "It receives the missing requirement\nand the relevant version,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/088.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 9,
      "start": 14230,
      "duration": 85,
      "text": "adds the report field\nand pushes another commit.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/089.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 9,
      "start": 14326,
      "duration": 101,
      "text": "The updated version follows\nthe same review policy.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/090.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 9,
      "start": 14438,
      "duration": 106,
      "text": "Sam’s Duet checks it\nand returns an approved result.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/091.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 9,
      "start": 14555,
      "duration": 90,
      "text": "Agent Loop can then send\nthe change to LoopLab,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/092.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 9,
      "start": 14656,
      "duration": 101,
      "text": "together with the requirement\nand the conditions to verify.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/093.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 9,
      "start": 14768,
      "duration": 144,
      "text": "Each handoff carries context the\nnext participant can use directly.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/094.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 10,
      "start": 14987,
      "duration": 93,
      "text": "Sam has supplied two acceptance conditions.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/095.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 10,
      "start": 15091,
      "duration": 102,
      "text": "The customer should see that\nthe application is in review,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/096.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 10,
      "start": 15204,
      "duration": 121,
      "text": "and the exported internal record\nshould contain the same status.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/097.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 10,
      "start": 15336,
      "duration": 176,
      "text": "LoopLab’s agent investigates the real pages\nand prepares reusable nodes and a test flow.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/098.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 10,
      "start": 15523,
      "duration": 124,
      "text": "An independent browser then executes\na fixed version of that flow,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/099.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 10,
      "start": 15658,
      "duration": 127,
      "text": "checking the page and export while\nrecording steps and screenshots.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/100.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 10,
      "start": 15796,
      "duration": 72,
      "text": "Replay follows the defined steps.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/101.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 10,
      "start": 15879,
      "duration": 105,
      "text": "A passing result returns\nto the workflow with evidence.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/102.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 10,
      "start": 15995,
      "duration": 132,
      "text": "If a check fails, Agent Loop\ncan send the failure location",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/103.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 10,
      "start": 16138,
      "duration": 140,
      "text": "and evidence back to Alex’s Duet for\nanother correction and verification.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/104.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 11,
      "start": 16353,
      "duration": 160,
      "text": "The acceptance report returns to the shared\ntopic and can be found in Message Center.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/105.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 11,
      "start": 16524,
      "duration": 132,
      "text": "Nora can see that the change she\nspotted has become a verified feature.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/106.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 11,
      "start": 16667,
      "duration": 143,
      "text": "Maya has evidence that the requirement\nis satisfied and can arrange the release.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/107.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 11,
      "start": 16821,
      "duration": 109,
      "text": "Alex’s and Sam’s Tracking\nrecords capture the correction,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/108.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 11,
      "start": 16941,
      "duration": 76,
      "text": "verification and supporting evidence.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/109.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 11,
      "start": 17028,
      "duration": 119,
      "text": "Each person follows the work\nfrom their own responsibilities,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/110.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 11,
      "start": 17158,
      "duration": 61,
      "text": "referring to the same result.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/111.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 11,
      "start": 17230,
      "duration": 104,
      "text": "When a decision is needed,\nDuet brings the progress,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/112.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 11,
      "start": 17345,
      "duration": 110,
      "text": "materials and remaining choices\ntogether for its employee.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/113.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 12,
      "start": 17530,
      "duration": 117,
      "text": "Looking back, Message Center\nmade the change discoverable.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/114.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 12,
      "start": 17658,
      "duration": 121,
      "text": "Duet understood and carried out\nthe work each person delegated.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/115.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 12,
      "start": 17790,
      "duration": 84,
      "text": "Agent Loop connected\nthe handoffs through rules,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/116.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 12,
      "start": 17885,
      "duration": 89,
      "text": "and LoopLab supplied acceptance evidence.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/117.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 12,
      "start": 17985,
      "duration": 121,
      "text": "A team can first establish how\na real piece of work should run,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/118.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 12,
      "start": 18117,
      "duration": 154,
      "text": "then turn its recurring handoffs into\npolicies defined by the responsible people.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/119.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 12,
      "start": 18282,
      "duration": 133,
      "text": "Employees continue to decide goals,\npriorities and commitments.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/120.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 12,
      "start": 18426,
      "duration": 106,
      "text": "As more outputs become usable\ninputs for the next role,",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/121.mp3"
    },
    {
      "scene": 12,
      "start": 18543,
      "duration": 137,
      "text": "the company can build its AI-native\nworkflows one process at a time.",
      "audio": "voiceover-v2/en/122.mp3"
    }
  ]
}
